WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Priya Raghunathan: Last thing — the Dunmore Street studio. The landlord has given us until the end of September at the current rate.

2
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Marcus Webb: And after that?

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Priya Raghunathan: Eighteen percent up. It is a five year lease, so that compounds badly.

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Marcus Webb: Then sign it before September. Can you own that?

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Priya Raghunathan: Yes. I will have the lease signed before the end of Q3.

6
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Dana Okonkwo: Does that mean we are committing to in-house podcast production for five years?

7
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Marcus Webb: It means we are committing to the room. What we put in it is a separate conversation.
